" data-end=3D"717">Frontend</strong> (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) pour l=E2=80=
=99interface utilisateur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"772" data-end=3D"855" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"774" data-end=3D"855" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"774=
" data-end=3D"785">Backend</strong> (Python, Django) pour la gestion des do=
nn=C3=A9es et de la logique m=C3=A9tier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"856" data-end=3D"936" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"858" data-end=3D"936" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"858=
" data-end=3D"877">Base de donn=C3=A9es</strong> (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite=
) pour stocker les informations.</p>
</li>
</ul>
