<p data-start=3D"984" data-end=3D"1071" class=3D"">Avant d=E2=80=99utiliser=
 Django, il est utile de comprendre certaines architectures courantes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1072" data-end=3D"1362">
<li data-start=3D"1072" data-end=3D"1146" class=3D"">
