te)</strong> : Django suit MVT, qui est similaire au MVC mais adapt=C3=A9 a=
u framework.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1362" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1281" data-end=3D"1362" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
281" data-end=3D"1298">Microservices</strong> : Plusieurs petits services c=
