<h2 data-start=3D"8359" data-end=3D"8410" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8362" data-end=3D"8410">5. Avantages et Inconv=C3=A9nients des FBV et CBV</=
strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8412" data-end=3D"8441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8416" data-end=3D"8441">5.1 Avantages des FBV</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8442" data-end=3D"8638">
<li data-start=3D"8442" data-end=3D"8484" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8444" data-end=3D"8484" class=3D"">Simplicit=C3=A9 et faci=
lit=C3=A9 de compr=C3=A9hension.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8485" data-end=3D"8566" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8487" data-end=3D"8566" class=3D"">Facile =C3=A0 utiliser =
pour des vues simples et des applications petites =C3=A0 moyennes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8567" data-end=3D"8638" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8569" data-end=3D"8638" class=3D"">Moins de code, pas beso=
in de cr=C3=A9er une classe pour des vues basiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8640" data-end=3D"8669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8644" data-end=3D"8669">5.2 Avantages des CBV</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8670" data-end=3D"9051">
<li data-start=3D"8670" data-end=3D"8759" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8672" data-end=3D"8759" class=3D"">Modularit=C3=A9 : vous =
pouvez organiser la logique en diff=C3=A9rentes m=C3=A9thodes et la r=C3=A9=
utiliser.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8760" data-end=3D"8837" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8762" data-end=3D"8837" class=3D"">Flexibilit=C3=A9 : gest=
ion de types de requ=C3=AAtes comme <code data-start=3D"8811" data-end=3D"8=
816">GET</code>, <code data-start=3D"8818" data-end=3D"8824">POST</code>, <=
code data-start=3D"8826" data-end=3D"8831">PUT</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8838" data-end=3D"8929" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8840" data-end=3D"8929" class=3D"">Utilisation de vues g=
=C3=A9n=C3=A9riques pour des cas d=E2=80=99usage courants (listes, formulai=
res, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8930" data-end=3D"9051" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8932" data-end=3D"9051" class=3D"">Extensibilit=C3=A9 : po=
ssibilit=C3=A9 de cr=C3=A9er des vues personnalis=C3=A9es en h=C3=A9ritant =
et en =C3=A9tendant des classes de vues g=C3=A9n=C3=A9riques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"9053" data-end=3D"9093" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9057" data-end=3D"9093">5.3 Inconv=C3=A9nients des FBV et CBV</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9095" data-end=3D"9104" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
095" data-end=3D"9104">FBV :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"9105" data-end=3D"9211">
<li data-start=3D"9105" data-end=3D"9146" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9107" data-end=3D"9146" class=3D"">Moins flexible pour les=
 vues complexes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9147" data-end=3D"9211" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9149" data-end=3D"9211" class=3D"">Peu de structure pour g=
=C3=A9rer des vues avec beaucoup de logique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"9213" data-end=3D"9222" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
213" data-end=3D"9222">CBV :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"9223" data-end=3D"9321">
<li data-start=3D"9223" data-end=3D"9274" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9225" data-end=3D"9274" class=3D"">Peut sembler plus compl=
exe pour des vues simples.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9275" data-end=3D"9321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9277" data-end=3D"9321" class=3D"">Plus de code =C3=A0 =C3=
=A9crire pour les vues de base.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"9323" data-end=3D"9326" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9328" data-end=3D"9348" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
