<h3 data-start=3D"5691" data-end=3D"5740" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5695" data-end=3D"5740">3.3. Suppression des Relations ForeignKey</strong><=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"5742" data-end=3D"6010" class=3D"">L'argument <code data-s=
tart=3D"5753" data-end=3D"5779">on_delete=3Dmodels.CASCADE</code> sp=C3=A9c=
ifie ce qu'il faut faire lorsqu'une instance du mod=C3=A8le parent (Article=
) est supprim=C3=A9e. Dans cet exemple, nous avons utilis=C3=A9 <code data-=
start=3D"5908" data-end=3D"5917">CASCADE</code>, ce qui signifie que tous l=
es commentaires associ=C3=A9s =C3=A0 un article seront =C3=A9galement suppr=
im=C3=A9s.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6012" data-end=3D"6366">
<li data-start=3D"6012" data-end=3D"6366" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6014" data-end=3D"6047" class=3D"">Autres options pour <co=
de data-start=3D"6034" data-end=3D"6045">on_delete</code> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6050" data-end=3D"6366">
<li data-start=3D"6050" data-end=3D"6124" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6052" data-end=3D"6124" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"605=
2" data-end=3D"6061">PROTECT</code> : emp=C3=AAche la suppression de l'obje=
t parent s=E2=80=99il est r=C3=A9f=C3=A9renc=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6127" data-end=3D"6222" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6129" data-end=3D"6222" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"612=
9" data-end=3D"6139">SET_NULL</code> : d=C3=A9finit la relation =C3=A0 <cod=
e data-start=3D"6164" data-end=3D"6170">NULL</code> (doit =C3=AAtre utilis=
=C3=A9 avec <code data-start=3D"6195" data-end=3D"6206">null=3DTrue</code> =
dans le champ).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6225" data-end=3D"6287" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6227" data-end=3D"6287" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"622=
7" data-end=3D"6240">SET_DEFAULT</code> : d=C3=A9finit la relation =C3=A0 u=
ne valeur par d=C3=A9faut.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6290" data-end=3D"6366" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6292" data-end=3D"6366" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"629=
2" data-end=3D"6304">DO_NOTHING</code> : ne fait rien, vous devez g=C3=A9re=
r la suppression manuellement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
