</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1364">
<li data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1267" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1119" data-end=3D"1267" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
119" data-end=3D"1130">Balises</strong> : Elles effectuent des actions comm=
e la gestion de la logique conditionnelle ou it=C3=A9rative (ex : <code dat=
a-start=3D"1227" data-end=3D"1238">{% for %}</code>, <code data-start=3D"12=
40" data-end=3D"1250">{% if %}</code>, <code data-start=3D"1252" data-end=
=3D"1265">{% block %}</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1268" data-end=3D"1364" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1270" data-end=3D"1364" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
