order comment s=C3=A9curiser vos templates Django contre des attaques coura=
ntes telles que <strong data-start=3D"263" data-end=3D"293">XSS (Cross-Site=
 Scripting)</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"295" data-end=3D"332">CSRF (Cro=
ss-Site Request Forgery)</strong> et d'autres vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9s, tou=
