<h3 data-start=3D"6476" data-end=3D"6532" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6480" data-end=3D"6532">3.2. Avantages de la modularisation via les apps</s=
trong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6534" data-end=3D"6877">
<li data-start=3D"6534" data-end=3D"6616" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6536" data-end=3D"6616" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
536" data-end=3D"6555">R=C3=A9utilisabilit=C3=A9</strong> : Une app Django =
peut =C3=AAtre r=C3=A9utilis=C3=A9e dans d'autres projets.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6617" data-end=3D"6740" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6619" data-end=3D"6740" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
619" data-end=3D"6652">Isolation des responsabilit=C3=A9s</strong> : Chaque=
 app a une responsabilit=C3=A9 claire, ce qui facilite la gestion et la mai=
ntenance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6741" data-end=3D"6877" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6743" data-end=3D"6877" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
743" data-end=3D"6772">Travail d=E2=80=99=C3=A9quipe facilit=C3=A9</strong>=
 : Diff=C3=A9rentes =C3=A9quipes peuvent travailler sur des apps s=C3=A9par=
=C3=A9es sans interf=C3=A9rer les unes avec les autres.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6879" data-end=3D"6948" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6883" data-end=3D"6948">3.3. Comment structurer vos apps pour maximiser la =
