<h3 data-start=3D"10568" data-end=3D"10617" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"10572" data-end=3D"10617">7.2. Tests d'int=C3=A9gration et d'acceptatio=
n</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"10619" data-end=3D"10803" class=3D"">Les tests d'int=C3=A9=
gration permettent de v=C3=A9rifier que les diff=C3=A9rentes apps interagis=
